<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-29T21:54:51.288Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:54:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russian Su-35 fighter jets and S-400 air defence systems have arrived in Ethiopia as fighting intensifies in Tigray and the Amhara region. Airstrikes have been reported around Rama for a third consecutive day, while a drone strike hit the Hayiq Jari 2 IDP camp in Amhara, killing 16 civilians and injuring 22. Armed attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in Oromia and a drone hit a shelter in South Wollo Zone, causing further casualties. Major General Yohannes, a senior Tigray military commander, was captured near the Eritrean border. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw78prj801pvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQSl9RZXktMzNjWWNNLUtNT1AySlhCNTltZ1ktWENhQVFWaVd3aGdDMkRZVFgzZktHWHp3Z0RKcENRb3NueEs0UHZRcS1yTmVlZTRrNndOSEhTRHBEVGJnQmc5WS1zMnQ5Ymx0VVRGNVpnR25oWG5UaVR6MTA1WXVoZXlQNEQ0WWdOeHB6eGhBSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQUDdieGl6YlpDbFo5dE1HZzMtRjVkb3JQWlJwRXZWcG4taEY0TmtYQ2pINnpyRWZoX28tQmRFUUtIQjBCbGs1SERCd2d3MlVuNllSejdSSkdLMGRsOWc4UTRRbldJZ2RvUXk1N2FBY1lxempTQjRvSkg1QXhTYmdVVWg1SlNwRXRrZU1kQ0t6dGdwZTFmVk00azd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bioengineer.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Townpress Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE9EOXhmTmd0QTNBeFVDUWZHb3dTSzFtdi1VZDFVVWh1WnhmMEdfdW5wZzdHWmlObl9SQ0pNd0pLaGNYVFVJVDhsb05wUnVORzQ2VlUtQ3Bfa2VjYkZuOWhnU21CMEFoWm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Amhara Association of America&lt;/a&gt;, 